      "versionNonce": 654321750,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792703854667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- N teams writing N clients = N copies of the same bugs.\n- TCS is on everyone's critical path: a bad failover\n  in one client still looks like 'TCS is down'.\n- The TCS team knows best how TCS should be called.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- N teams writing N clients = N copies of the same bugs.\n- TCS is on everyone's critical path: a bad failover\n  in one client still looks like 'TCS is down'.\n- The TCS team knows best how TCS should be called.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
